|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| HW Transforms |                             |              | After hardware transfomations                                                          |
|               | (1) lowering                | 29,379       | initial conversion to HW specific instructions                                         |
|               | (2) optimizations           | 29,436       | high level synthesis optimizations                                                     |
